Q: How to set up CodeIgniter site on localhost? A: <p>There is an error in your route file at line 3 :</p>

<pre><code>$route['default_controller'] = "admin";
$route['scaffolding_trigger'] = "";  
==&gt; employee_punchin|admin)\S*'] = "reserve/routing/$1";
</code></pre>

<p>should fix it:</p>

<pre><code>$route['(employee_punchin|admin)\S*'] = "reserve/routing/$1";
</code></pre>

<p>in your index.php file, change the ENVIRONMENT to development to display errors :</p>

<pre><code>define('ENVIRONMENT', 'development');
</code></pre>
